# Catalogue-scan artefacts. Regenerable and, since 2026-09-09, redundant:
# every scanned product is persisted to supplier_scan_results (see
# app/models.py). The .jsonl checkpoints remain the resume mechanism and
# tools/backfill_scan_results.py can replay them, but they are working
# files, not source.
